OL,3,GNEWSAUp to 600 expected at women's
OL,4,Asafety run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA women's running group is expecting up
OL,7,Fto 600 people at an event being held as
OL,8,Fpart of a safety campaign it launched
OL,9,Fafter members reported being harassed
OL,10,Fand intimidated.
OL,12,FThe group, called It's Run By Her, was
OL,13,Ffounded by Sophie Allmark and created
OL,14,Fits Safer Steps campaign in response
OL,15,Fthings members had experienced while
OL,16,Fout running in Bognor Regis and the
OL,17,Fsurrounding areas.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
