OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUp to 600 expected at women's
OL,4,Asafety run
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year's inaugural event was
OL,7,Fattended by more than 350 people.
OL,8,F"Overwhelmed" by the turnout, the group
OL,9,Fdecided to organise a second event,
OL,10,Fbeing held on Wednesday.
OL,12,FAllmark said the campaign had sparked a
OL,13,F"powerful" conversation, including
OL,14,Famong local men, with many expected to
OL,15,Fattend on Wednesday.
